OL,3,ACan the Zelda remake capture the magic
OL,4,Aof the original?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time
OL,7,Fwas finally released on Thursday, after
OL,8,Fyears of rumours that Nintendo would
OL,9,Fremake the game - considered one of the
OL,10,Fbest ever made.
OL,12,FIGN called it "the biggest game of the
OL,13,Fdecade" in their review when it
OL,14,Flaunched in 1998 on the N64, and it set
OL,15,Fthe standard for 3D games.
OL,17,FA lot of the things we take for granted
OL,18,Fin modern games - such as riding a
OL,19,Fhorse, fighting with a sword and
OL,20,Fshield, or locking on to enemies with
OL,21,Fthe tap of a button - were pioneered or
OL,22,Fperfected in Ocarina of Time.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
