OL,3,AMonty Don bids 'final goodbye' to
OL,4,AGardeners' World after two decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FTV horticulturalist Monty Don thanked
OL,7,Fviewers and his furry friend Ned the
OL,8,Fdog while presenting his final episode
OL,9,Fof Gardeners' World, after more than
OL,10,Ftwo decades on air.
OL,12,FThe head gardener on the long-running
OL,13,FBBC TV series signed off from
OL,14,FLongmeadow garden, where the show has
OL,15,Fbeen based for 16 years, on Friday.
OL,17,F"From myself, Ned, and Longmeadow it's
OL,18,Fthe final goodbye," he said on the
OL,19,Fprogramme, adding it had been "a
OL,20,Fprivilege and pleasure" to share his
OL,21,Fgarden experiences with so many people.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
