OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGladiator II stuntman sues over
OL,4,Ainjuries from on-set explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe "panicked and ran" before colleagues
OL,7,Fthrew bottles of water over his burns,
OL,8,Fwhich covered about 15% of his body,
OL,9,Fincluding his face, his arms and hands,
OL,10,Fhe said.
OL,12,FSarsfield is suing August Street Films,
OL,13,Fwhose defence said it admits liability
OL,14,Ffor the accident, but has not made an
OL,15,Fadmission about the alleged injuries or
OL,16,Fagreed to the requested #200,000
OL,17,Fdamages.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
